ruxex --worktree login: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `ruxex fork`, `ruxex exec`, and `ruxex exec fork`
ruxex fork --worktree: `ruxex fork --worktree` requires an explicit session ID
ruxex fork --worktree --last: `ruxex fork --worktree` requires an explicit session ID
ruxex exec resume --worktree session: `--worktree` cannot resume an existing session; use `ruxex exec fork --worktree`
ruxex exec review --worktree: `--worktree` is not supported for code review
ruxex resume --worktree session: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `ruxex fork`, `ruxex exec`, and `ruxex exec fork`
ruxex archive session --worktree: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `ruxex fork`, `ruxex exec`, and `ruxex exec fork`
ruxex queue --thread session --message hi --worktree: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `ruxex fork`, `ruxex exec`, and `ruxex exec fork`
